sequenceDiagram
  participant Addon as Concrete Connector Addon
  participant Backend as Backend Record
  participant Endpoint as Endpoint Record
  participant Framework as Webhooks Framework
  participant Glue as Glue Mixins

  Addon->>Backend: Inherit connector.backend plus Glue mixins
  Addon->>Endpoint: Seed endpoint XML records
  Backend->>Endpoint: Set connector_backend_ref
  Framework->>Glue: Resolve backend from endpoint reference

  alt Inbound dispatch
    Framework->>Glue: _handle_inbound_webhook_event(event)
    Glue-->>Framework: done, retry, dead_letter, or cancel
  else Outbound dispatch
    Framework->>Glue: _handle_outbound_webhook_delivery(...)
    Glue-->>Framework: send, mutate, or terminal outcome
  end
